[[Image:PostmanT.png|left]]''<font style="font-size:15px">{{Quote|Come rain, wind, snow or sleet, the Postman is responsible for delivering all the important deliveries in [[Free Realms|Free Realms™]]. Mailboxes and other Postmen often host quests and challenges that require someone fleet of foot and swift of mind to sort and deliver packages on time. Don't be late!|Job description}}</font>''
'''Postman''' is a delivery [[Jobs|job]], specializing in delivering the mail. A freestyle class job, experience is gained by completing [[Quests|quests]] and by playing the Postman [[Mini-Games|minigames]].

==Skills==
{|text-align="center" cellpadding=6
!bgcolor="silver"|Skill
!bgcolor="silver"|Effect
|-
|Mail Throw
|Throws the mail into the targeted mailbox
|-
|bgcolor="#F5F5F5"|Toss Bone
|bgcolor="#F5F5F5"|Tosses a bone to distract dogs from knocking the postman over
|}

==Unlocking Postman==
Postman can be unlocked by speaking to Felipe in [[Sanctuary]].

Alternately, interacting with a set of postboxes inside a town before having the job adds a quest to the journal directing the player to Felipe.

